  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Good morning, guys.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 2.88,
      "end_time": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Morning, Andrew.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 5.44,
      "end_time": 6.32
    },
    {
      "text": "How you doing?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 6.32,
      "end_time": 6.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Very good.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 7.6,
      "end_time": 8.16
    },
    {
      "text": "How are you both?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 8.16,
      "end_time": 8.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, good.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 9.68,
      "end_time": 10.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you very much.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 10.28,
      "end_time": 11.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 11.52,
      "end_time": 12.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 14.16,
      "end_time": 14.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Goodness.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 14.56,
      "end_time": 17.36
    },
    {
      "text": "And two note takers.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 17.6,
      "end_time": 19.36
    },
    {
      "text": "One for Ahmed, one for me.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 21.68,
      "end_time": 23.2
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm surrounded.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 24.96,
      "end_time": 26.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Do you know what, Andrew?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 27.25,
      "end_time": 28.29
    },
    {
      "text": "They turn up on their own, but obviously you let them both in.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 28.29,
      "end_time": 31.89
    },
    {
      "text": "Followers everywhere.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 33.57,
      "end_time": 34.53
    },
    {
      "text": "You've been really busy.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 35.25,
      "end_time": 36.49
    },
    {
      "text": "So how are you doing?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 36.49,
      "end_time": 37.41
    },
    {
      "text": "You've completed a few acquisitions since we last spoke.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 37.57,
      "end_time": 40.29
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, we have been busy, Andy.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 40.61,
      "end_time": 42.53
    },
    {
      "text": "I'd say we've had quite a productive 20, 25.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 42.85,
      "end_time": 46.69
    },
    {
      "text": "So we're obviously quite pleased that we've managed to get and completed.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 49.01,
      "end_time": 53.91
    },
    {
      "text": "You know, obviously these things are always a bit fraught.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 54.23,
      "end_time": 57.19
    },
    {
      "text": "So, yeah, I think we're pretty happy and looking forward to having a sort of a short break, I guess over Christmas before it all gets.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 58.23,
      "end_time": 67.27
    },
    {
      "text": "Gets going again.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 67.27,
      "end_time": 68.31
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, me too, me too.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 69.35,
      "end_time": 71.55
    },
    {
      "text": "Definitely.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 71.55,
      "end_time": 71.99
    },
    {
      "text": "I think starting next week I'm going to be putting my feet up a little bit more.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 72.23,
      "end_time": 76.23
    },
    {
      "text": "But we still got some deals to close.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 76.87,
      "end_time": 78.47
    },
    {
      "text": "So you have.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 78.55,
      "end_time": 80.34
    },
    {
      "text": "How have things been overall then?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 81.86,
      "end_time": 83.38
    },
    {
      "text": "You've been, You've been busy?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 83.38,
      "end_time": 84.66
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, so we've had.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 86.18,
      "end_time": 87.46
    },
    {
      "text": "We've had about four or five deals just hanging, hanging in the air for the last two months maybe.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 88.02,
      "end_time": 94.66
    },
    {
      "text": "But as, as is always the case when Christmas and the end of the year rears its head, everybody's rushing to finally get the deals done.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 94.66,
      "end_time": 103.78
    },
    {
      "text": "So, yeah, I mean, it's just a little bit chaotic, but just trying to close everything before the end of the year.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 103.78,
      "end_time": 110.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 115.6,
      "end_time": 116.08
    },
    {
      "text": "So what is, what is your thoughts around process sales then?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 116.32,
      "end_time": 120.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Are you.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 120.68,
      "end_time": 121.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Are you guys still into.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 122,
      "end_time": 123.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, I take you still interest.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 123.52,
      "end_time": 124.6
    },
    {
      "text": "You're talking about meeting Tracy.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 124.6,
      "end_time": 126.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I mean, truthfully, we've really had.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 127.36,
      "end_time": 130.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Not had.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 130.56,
      "end_time": 131.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Very much time to really focus on it and now we've got a little bit of breathing space.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 133.59,
      "end_time": 139.35
    },
    {
      "text": "I think it's a chance for us to do so.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 139.75,
      "end_time": 141.83
    },
    {
      "text": "I think we're still weighing up the thought process around.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 143.99,
      "end_time": 150.71
    },
    {
      "text": "Clearly there's a strong level of expertise in the business.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 151.67,
      "end_time": 155.99
    },
    {
      "text": "I think if the assumption is that Tracey's staying for a reasonable period of time.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 156.39,
      "end_time": 161.83
    },
    {
      "text": "That could potentially benefit the events that we're already running and those that.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 163.93,
      "end_time": 169.33
    },
    {
      "text": "We'D like to launch.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 169.33,
      "end_time": 170.25
    },
    {
      "text": "I think there's still some reservations around the expertise is that does it fit?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 171.21,
      "end_time": 176.97
    },
    {
      "text": "Clearly they've got some relating to.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 177.13,
      "end_time": 179.53
    },
    {
      "text": "The exhibition space.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 181.29,
      "end_time": 182.73
    },
    {
      "text": "And I think the other aspect is so assessing their capabilities now for the type of stuff we're doing.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 184.25,
      "end_time": 191.37
    },
    {
      "text": "Also the potential conflict of interest, not necessarily around the customers that she has, being concerned about them being part of the group, but more if we're looking after those customers.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 192.31,
      "end_time": 205.75
    },
    {
      "text": "How much capacity is there actually to service inside the group?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 205.75,
      "end_time": 210.55
    },
    {
      "text": "So those are the things I'd like to dig into properly with her and really try and get some firm answers if we can.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 211.43,
      "end_time": 219.67
    },
    {
      "text": "I know she's kindly spent some time with some of the senior team already, but we might want to revisit that.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 222.02,
      "end_time": 228.26
    },
    {
      "text": "And one of the questions I have for you guys is, is there going to be an opportunity to perhaps meet with her two senior team members as part of a process?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 228.42,
      "end_time": 238.5
    },
    {
      "text": "Because I think they're pretty key.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 239.78,
      "end_time": 241.38
    },
    {
      "text": "I know she's saying that she is happy to still be involved, but I think from our perspective longer term they would be quite integral, I think, to.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 241.46,
      "end_time": 249.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Our confidence around the kind of the future of that.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 249.68,
      "end_time": 252.56
    },
    {
      "text": "And lastly is to get some up to date financials.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 253.6,
      "end_time": 256.72
    },
    {
      "text": "I know we did get some financial information, but given we are now at the end of the year, it'll be really good to understand how they perform this year, what their expectations are for 2026.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 256.72,
      "end_time": 266.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I think we probably have those to hand somewhere, don't we, Ahmed?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 268.48,
      "end_time": 271.24
    },
    {
      "text": "The up to date ones?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 271.24,
      "end_time": 272.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, we can, we can fire those off to you or we'll upload them to the date room and give you the link.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 272.08,
      "end_time": 277.81
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, but we've got those.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 278.53,
      "end_time": 279.97
    },
    {
      "text": "We've got those.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 280.21,
      "end_time": 281.01
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 281.33,
      "end_time": 281.69
    },
    {
      "text": "And in terms of speaking to a senior team.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 281.69,
      "end_time": 284.17
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, happy to do that.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 284.17,
      "end_time": 285.33
    },
    {
      "text": "So the, the conversation that I've had with her, Andrew, is that she is really keen to do a transaction with you guys based on really the fact that she feels she would have a home personally with you for several years.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 285.41,
      "end_time": 299.45
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, she's not looking to leave.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 299.45,
      "end_time": 301.85
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 302.49,
      "end_time": 303.13
    },
    {
      "text": "So she's definitely decided that that's, I mean, that's obviously because there was some, you know, uncertainty I think around that at the beginning of the process.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 303.13,
      "end_time": 311.69
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 312.73,
      "end_time": 313.69
    },
    {
      "text": "But I think she likes what, what's been laid out and a role for her, particularly around training and mentoring and, and the stuff that she was ambitious about anyway.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 313.69,
      "end_time": 325.45
    },
    {
      "text": "So, yeah, I think she's looking at a long term roll with you guys, if there is one, she will be happy to stay longer.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 326.17,
      "end_time": 331.75
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 332.39,
      "end_time": 333.03
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 333.11,
      "end_time": 333.55
    },
    {
      "text": "Well that's, that's really good to know.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 333.55,
      "end_time": 335.11
    },
    {
      "text": "So you're talking to her tomorrow.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 337.51,
      "end_time": 339.31
    },
    {
      "text": "Andy, did you say.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 339.31,
      "end_time": 340.47
    },
    {
      "text": "I actually spoke to her yesterday.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 342.63,
      "end_time": 344.71
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, okay, sorry, misunderstood.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 345.11,
      "end_time": 347.75
    },
    {
      "text": "Is she in the UK over the sort of.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 348.07,
      "end_time": 350.99
    },
    {
      "text": "She is, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 350.99,
      "end_time": 351.99
    },
    {
      "text": "She's coming over on the 19th.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 351.99,
      "end_time": 353.458
    },
    {
      "text": "19th I think she said so she would have that week before Christmas.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 353.562,
      "end_time": 357
    },
    {
      "text": "She's in Hertfordshire, Andrew.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 357.24,
      "end_time": 359.24
    },
    {
      "text": "So she did say that she would be willing to drive to Norfolk to meet with you guys.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 359.24,
      "end_time": 365.84
    },
    {
      "text": "So.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 365.84,
      "end_time": 366.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 366.92,
      "end_time": 367.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I Need to just think about.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 368.84,
      "end_time": 370.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Do you know how long she's over here for?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 370.52,
      "end_time": 372.92
    },
    {
      "text": "I believe for Christmas, I'm assuming at least a week and a bit if she's coming on the 19th, so.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 375.24,
      "end_time": 380.95
    },
    {
      "text": "Right, right.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 381.1,
      "end_time": 382.38
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 382.38,
      "end_time": 382.94
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me try.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 382.94,
      "end_time": 383.74
    },
    {
      "text": "I just need to.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 383.9,
      "end_time": 385.1
    },
    {
      "text": "Try and work.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 386.62,
      "end_time": 387.42
    },
    {
      "text": "Through availability really, because in some instances the.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 387.42,
      "end_time": 392.7
    },
    {
      "text": "The offices will be shut, so.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 393.98,
      "end_time": 396.46
    },
    {
      "text": "And some people I know are away.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 396.54,
      "end_time": 398.54
    },
    {
      "text": "For Christmas, so it's just a question of whether we.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 398.86,
      "end_time": 401.54
    },
    {
      "text": "What.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 401.54,
      "end_time": 401.9
    },
    {
      "text": "What we could put together.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 401.98,
      "end_time": 403.1
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 404.86,
      "end_time": 405.3
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm away not until.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 405.3,
      "end_time": 406.42
    },
    {
      "text": "But not until the 23rd, so it's possible that.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 406.42,
      "end_time": 409.82
    },
    {
      "text": "Worst case, I will be able to meet her for sure.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 413.84,
      "end_time": 416.32
    },
    {
      "text": "But it would be helpful, I think, if there's others.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 416.64,
      "end_time": 418.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, so I'll come back to you on that.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 419.84,
      "end_time": 421.52
    },
    {
      "text": "All right.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 423.6,
      "end_time": 424.08
    },
    {
      "text": "And obviously if you need any zoom calls in the interim, she would be happy to do those as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 424.32,
      "end_time": 429.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Great.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 430.16,
      "end_time": 430.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 430.96,
      "end_time": 431.6
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, well, if.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 432.96,
      "end_time": 433.84
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, if you can send those.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 434.08,
      "end_time": 435.52
    },
    {
      "text": "The numbers.",
