      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 530.24,
      "end_time": 530.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, so if she lands the 19th, then it is going to be 20th, 21st or 22nd.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 530.96,
      "end_time": 535.92
