      "start_time": 635.56,
      "end_time": 636.16
    },
    {
      "text": "It makes it a little bit nervous.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 638.49,
      "end_time": 639.73
    },
    {
      "text": "We're just having a younger boss as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 639.73,
      "end_time": 641.45
    },
    {
      "text": "I would say he's probably mid-30s, but I, I know him quite well and he has got a really good business and they are acquiring.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 641.61,
      "end_time": 650.41
    },
    {
      "text": "But yeah, I think she feels culturally she would be more aligned with you guys, so.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy",
      "start_time": 651.13,
      "end_time": 656.01
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, Good to know.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 657.05,
      "end_time": 658.25
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, good to know.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 658.25,
      "end_time": 659.21
    },
    {
      "text": "Great.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 661.53,
      "end_time": 661.93
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, good stuff.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew  Schofield",
      "start_time": 662.09,
      "end_time": 663.37
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, well, thanks for that.",
